    "verdict_rationale": "Thresholds 20/30/70/80 do not correspond to stable, symmetrical, or regime-invariant percentiles across horizons. Hardcoding them as production buy/sell triggers would fabricate false signals. They remain unvalidated research hypotheses until dynamic/quantile-based bands are investigated."
